    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat percentage younger is Nani's sister than Nani? Nani is 9 years old. Nani's sister is 20% younger than Nani.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Nani is 8 years old.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. Nani's sister is 25% younger than Nani.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: Nani's sister's age is compared with Nani's age using Nani's age as the reference.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Great. Now let's take that a step further. How old will Nani be when her sister turns 10? Also, here's some relevant info: Nani's sister is currently 6 years old.\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"Here's another detail: Nani and her sister will age by one year each year.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
