    },
    {
      "content": "Nani is **8 years old**.\n\n- Nani’s sister is 25% younger, so her age is  \n  \\(8 \\times (1 - 0.25) = 8 \\times 0.75 = 6\\) years.\n- Nani’s brother is twice Nani’s age:  \n  \\(2 \\times 8 = 16\\) years.\n\nTotal age:\n\n\\[\n8 + 6 + 16 = 30\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{30\\text{ years}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
