  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Nani’s sister is stated to be **20% younger** than Nani.\n\nCheck:  \n\\[\n20\\%\\text{ of }9=0.20\\times 9=1.8\n\\]\nSo her sister would be \\(9-1.8=7.2\\) years old, which is a \\(20\\%\\) reduction from Nani’s age.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n\\]",
    "Nani’s sister is still **20% younger** than Nani.\n\nHer age is:\n\\[\n8-(20\\%\\times 8)=8-1.6=6.4\n\\]\n\nSo Nani’s sister is **6.4 years old**, and the percentage younger is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n\\]",
    "Nani is 8 years old, and her sister is **25% younger**.\n\nHer sister’s age is:\n\\[\n8-(25\\%\\times 8)=8-2=6\n\\]\n\nTherefore, Nani’s sister is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{25\\%}\n\\]",
